Day 73: Promote a Retrained Model via a Champion/Challenger Gate
Overview
Implemented a metric-gated champion/challenger promotion script (/root/code/monitoring/promote.py) for the fraud-detector model registered in MLflow on the KodeKloud Task environment. Instead of promoting retrained models blindly, the gate compares the f1_score of the version currently serving the production alias against challenger version 2, re-pointing the production alias to version 2 only when challenger_f1 > champion_f1 (0.82 > 0.71).

