Key Takeaways
Alias-Driven Serving: MLflow 3.x uses model aliases such as production (models:/fraud-detector@production) rather than legacy stage transitions, allowing zero-downtime pointer updates once validation passes.

Strict Metric Gating: Checking challenger_f1 > champion_f1 prevents lower- or equal-performing candidates from replacing the active production model.

Safe Environment Handling: Keeping /root/code/monitoring/retrain_pipeline.py untouched on disk while addressing the MLflow skops sklearn.tree._tree.Tree check preserved the lab's baseline setup.
